WEBVTT

01:53.080 --> 01:55.040
My Lord, the Snow Dragon Whisker
has been found.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.240
Where is it?

01:58.120 --> 01:59.200
In the Crown Prince's hands.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.880
After the great fire in Qingzhou,

02:01.960 --> 02:03.120
the Nanyue royal family,
seeking the Crown Prince's favor,

02:03.200 --> 02:05.880
secretly sent him a ten-year-nurtured
Snow Dragon Whisker seed

02:05.960 --> 02:07.920
via the black market.

02:08.560 --> 02:10.039
Only by bringing down the Crown Prince

02:10.120 --> 02:11.320
can we get the Snow Dragon Whisker.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.360
Got it.

02:16.040 --> 02:18.680
No matter what,
we need to wake up my father first.

02:20.920 --> 02:22.120
As for Mei Lin…

03:31.600 --> 03:33.000
It's an Undying Flower.

03:37.320 --> 03:39.120
When I went out of the palace today,

03:40.680 --> 03:42.280
I saw some Undying Flowers.

03:43.000 --> 03:44.560
His Majesty will be fine.

04:01.120 --> 04:02.840
Is there a problem
with the Emperor's antidote?

04:10.320 --> 04:11.520
It's easy to prepare the antidote,

04:12.400 --> 04:15.160
but it's very hard to take it
into the Yanming Palace.

04:16.120 --> 04:17.800
If the Crown Prince realizes

04:17.880 --> 04:20.000
we've uncovered
that my father was poisoned,

04:20.079 --> 04:21.720
he will become desperate
and act recklessly.

04:22.520 --> 04:24.600
At that time,
my father will be in real danger.

04:25.200 --> 04:26.440
What's your plan?

04:30.400 --> 04:31.480
To detoxify my father,

04:31.560 --> 04:33.800
we can only secretly seek
Liu Zhong's assistance.

04:35.040 --> 04:37.360
But it's very difficult to see Liu Zhong.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.600
Maybe one person can help us.

04:53.040 --> 04:55.640
Concubine Yan visits the lotus pond
at the Chen and You hours daily

04:55.720 --> 04:59.400
to release an Eternal Life Ship
in prayer for the Emperor.

05:01.480 --> 05:04.920
WISH THE EMPEROR GOOD HEALTH

05:05.720 --> 05:08.400
We can send her a message
through the Eternal Life Ship.

05:15.880 --> 05:17.800
WITHIN THREE FEET
ALL ILLNESSES VANISH

05:33.720 --> 05:35.320
The gods have manifested.

05:36.160 --> 05:37.360
Look, Your Highness.

05:42.520 --> 05:44.160
It's the Eternal Life Ship.

05:52.480 --> 05:55.720
Within three feet, all illnesses vanish.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.480
This is Mei Lin's writing.

05:59.080 --> 06:00.080
What does she mean?

06:03.800 --> 06:05.600
Mei Lin has found a deity
who can save His Majesty.

06:05.680 --> 06:07.400
Let's go to Yanming Palace.

06:08.320 --> 06:10.120
Her Highness will surely recognize
my writing

06:10.200 --> 06:12.760
and send the Eternal Life Ship
to Yanming Palace.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.600
However, due
to your relationship with her,

06:15.680 --> 06:18.880
she is likely under constant surveillance
by the Crown Prince.

06:20.640 --> 06:22.560
YANMING PALACE

06:22.640 --> 06:23.760
Your Highness.

06:24.520 --> 06:25.600
What are you holding?

06:25.680 --> 06:27.720
This is the Eternal Life Ship
I used for my prayers.

06:27.800 --> 06:30.000
If placed within three feet
of His Majesty's bedside,

06:30.080 --> 06:32.080
he will surely recover
from all his ailments.

06:32.160 --> 06:33.120
Look.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.920
This is specially made secret ink.

06:46.800 --> 06:49.960
Without my prompt,
no one else can see the hidden message.

06:55.520 --> 06:56.760
Concubine Yan will provide them

06:57.400 --> 06:59.760
with an ordinary Eternal Life Ship
for blessings.

07:01.680 --> 07:03.320
It won't raise suspicion.

07:03.400 --> 07:05.360
His Majesty did not dote on you in vain.

07:06.840 --> 07:08.160
However, your intentions

07:09.680 --> 07:11.000
might not be able to get through.

07:20.640 --> 07:22.320
YANMING PALACE

07:22.400 --> 07:24.800
- Eunuch Liu.
- Your Highness.

07:25.880 --> 07:28.440
I understand your good intentions.

07:28.520 --> 07:30.600
Once His Majesty wakes,
he will understand them as well.

07:31.320 --> 07:34.080
Please go back to Fanghua Palace.

07:36.920 --> 07:37.760
Eunuch Liu,

07:38.760 --> 07:42.240
look, this is a deity of Great Yan.
It's sure to work.

07:42.320 --> 07:44.960
WITHIN THREE FEET
ALL ILLNESSES VANISH

07:48.080 --> 07:51.640
Will Eunuch Liu accept
the Eternal Life Ship for blessings?

07:52.240 --> 07:53.920
As long as he sees
the portrait of Shennong,

07:54.000 --> 07:55.320
he'll accept it.

07:58.600 --> 08:01.120
Rebel! Trying to drive me to my grave?

08:09.480 --> 08:10.480
Father,

08:11.200 --> 08:13.760
I know I was wrong.

08:14.360 --> 08:17.160
Father, if you harm yourself in anger,

08:17.240 --> 08:20.440
I would be beyond redemption.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.760
This gesture shows you admit your mistake.

08:29.840 --> 08:31.520
Eunuch Liu taught me that.

08:32.360 --> 08:34.799
Reflecting on my childhood mischief,

08:34.880 --> 08:36.960
I was fortunate
to have Eunuch Liu's secret help,

08:37.039 --> 08:39.080
sparing me much suffering.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.640
I will hint to Eunuch Liu
how to read the secret message

08:42.720 --> 08:44.120
using the portrait of Shennong.

08:44.880 --> 08:48.600
Your Highness, was this portrait
of Shennong painted by you?

08:51.680 --> 08:53.840
Eunuch Liu,
it's the manifestation of gods.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.920
Please give it a try. It will work.

08:56.000 --> 08:56.840
Your Highness.

09:03.400 --> 09:04.520
Bring me some ginger slices and vinegar.

09:04.600 --> 09:05.440
Yes.

09:26.520 --> 09:28.280
My father did not suffer a stroke.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.840
He was poisoned by the Crown Prince.

09:30.360 --> 09:33.440
The conflict between the incense
and the tonics caused his coma.

09:37.600 --> 09:38.560
Your Majesty.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.680
Mei Lin, Eunuch Liu
has received the message.

09:46.760 --> 09:47.600
We have succeeded.

09:49.160 --> 09:50.240
Really?

09:50.320 --> 09:52.200
My father should wake up very soon.

09:53.120 --> 09:54.760
You didn't sleep well these days.

09:54.840 --> 09:56.000
Take a nap.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.000
But I'm too happy to fall asleep.

10:01.160 --> 10:03.440
Would you like to try the method
you used to help me fall asleep

10:03.520 --> 10:05.520
in the Court of State Ceremonial?

10:07.640 --> 10:08.560
Do you want to knock me out?

10:10.320 --> 10:11.600
I can't bear to do so.

10:14.280 --> 10:15.120
My Lord,

10:19.120 --> 10:20.160
the medicine you ordered is ready.

10:21.040 --> 10:22.440
Are you ill?

10:22.520 --> 10:24.000
This is a soothing soup
I prepared for you.

10:24.080 --> 10:27.120
It helps with sleep
and is good for your health.

10:39.760 --> 10:41.360
This medicine is so bitter.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.600
We agreed to share
both good and hard times together.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.200
It truly is very bitter.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.200
Take a nap.

11:34.760 --> 11:36.880
YANMING PALACE

11:50.360 --> 11:53.520
If my father is unable to open his mouth
or take any liquids,

11:53.600 --> 11:55.280
place the antidote in the incense burner

11:55.800 --> 11:57.520
and let it fume
for one incense stick each day.

11:58.200 --> 12:00.560
The toxins may clear after three days.

12:18.240 --> 12:19.080
Your Majesty.

12:33.560 --> 12:35.640
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.

12:36.520 --> 12:37.360
Your Majesty.

13:22.240 --> 13:23.120
Stop!

13:26.360 --> 13:28.960
What are you doing?
What do you want to do?

13:34.280 --> 13:36.880
- Your Highness.
- Eunuch Liu.

13:40.400 --> 13:42.600
I just want to release

13:42.680 --> 13:44.440
an Eternal Life Ship for blessings
for His Majesty.

13:45.120 --> 13:47.520
Do you have to stop me?

13:49.680 --> 13:51.440
So, you are seeking help from the gods,

13:51.520 --> 13:52.920
not my third brother.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.000
- Arrest him.
- Yes.

13:58.960 --> 14:00.280
- What are you doing?
- Go. Go.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.560
Your Highness,

14:01.640 --> 14:02.920
I just want to pray for blessings.

14:03.000 --> 14:05.320
I want to pray for blessings
for His Majesty.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.920
Without Eunuch Liu,

14:10.000 --> 14:12.240
Jinghe will seek Luomei's help.

14:13.240 --> 14:14.600
Keep a close watch,

14:15.760 --> 14:17.280
especially on Mei Lin.

14:19.920 --> 14:20.760
Yes.

14:22.680 --> 14:26.440
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

14:26.520 --> 14:29.800
My Lord, Eunuch Liu has been
captured by the Crown Prince.

14:34.200 --> 14:35.320
The only person who can rescue Eunuch Liu

14:35.920 --> 14:38.360
without alerting the Crown Prince's spies
is General Yin.

14:39.680 --> 14:42.600
However, we received no reply
to our previous messages to her.

14:46.840 --> 14:48.960
The day after tomorrow
will be my final inspection of the camp.

14:49.560 --> 14:50.440
By then,

14:50.520 --> 14:52.800
I will present to the court
a well-disciplined Pingnan Army

14:52.880 --> 14:54.640
with clear defense protocols.

14:58.480 --> 14:59.320
Go to the West Suburban Guard Post.

14:59.400 --> 15:01.600
Today is General Yin's last inspection
of the camp.

15:01.680 --> 15:03.280
There aren't many spies in the army.

15:03.360 --> 15:05.040
This is our last chance.

15:14.280 --> 15:15.240
Greetings, General.

15:16.120 --> 15:18.480
- Greetings, General.
- Greetings, General.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.920
Greetings, General.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.280
Today is my last inspection of the camp.

15:40.360 --> 15:42.000
From now on,

15:51.040 --> 15:52.560
even though I will no longer
be in the army,

15:53.160 --> 15:55.480
the Pingnan Army must keep their oaths

15:56.040 --> 15:58.120
and protect the people of Great Yan.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.040
I, Yin Luomei,

16:00.840 --> 16:02.800
will always be a comrade
of the Pingnan Army.

16:04.360 --> 16:06.680
Remove the armor. Take down the flag.

16:08.040 --> 16:11.360
YIN

16:32.520 --> 16:36.280
YAN

16:46.080 --> 16:47.680
Farewell, General!

16:58.240 --> 16:59.800
Who are you? Come out.

17:03.520 --> 17:05.440
General Yin, it's me.

17:06.240 --> 17:07.640
I've come to deliver a message
from Prince Jing.

17:08.280 --> 17:10.240
How dare you trespass
into the military camp?

17:10.319 --> 17:11.560
Aren't you afraid I would kill you?

17:13.200 --> 17:14.520
I know you

17:15.079 --> 17:17.040
and General Weibei
are both humane commanders

17:17.640 --> 17:19.200
who would not kill innocents
indiscriminately.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.880
The General's Mansion won't participate
in the struggle for succession.

17:21.960 --> 17:23.400
I can't give Prince Jing what he wants.

17:25.359 --> 17:26.800
TO GENERAL YIN

17:26.880 --> 17:28.000
Please read the letter, General.

17:33.320 --> 17:34.320
How dare you

17:34.960 --> 17:36.560
enter the tent
without announcing yourself!

17:37.080 --> 17:38.320
Please pardon me, Your Highness.

17:38.400 --> 17:39.840
The Crown Prince has important matters
to discuss with you.

17:39.920 --> 17:42.400
Please return to the palace
as soon as possible.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.680
PERSONALLY ADDRESSED TO GENERAL YIN

17:43.760 --> 17:44.640
You go back first.

17:44.720 --> 17:47.160
After addressing military affairs,
I will return to the palace.

17:51.960 --> 17:52.800
Yes.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.240
Tell Prince Jing

18:02.160 --> 18:03.840
that I am now the Crown Princess.

18:04.520 --> 18:06.680
No matter what happens,
I will stand with the Eastern Palace.

18:07.960 --> 18:09.440
If he tries to sow discord again,

18:10.280 --> 18:11.920
don't blame me for showing no mercy
despite our past.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.200
Jiangtu,

18:15.120 --> 18:16.520
escort her back to Prince Jing's Mansion.

18:18.040 --> 18:18.880
Yes.

18:44.040 --> 18:44.960
Set up a perimeter one li away.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.360
No one is allowed to approach.

18:46.440 --> 18:47.280
Yes.

19:00.160 --> 19:03.040
I didn't expect you still remember
how to beat the Great Yan charge drum.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.200
Only General Weibei

19:05.280 --> 19:07.360
would add an extra beat
to the three rounds.

19:30.240 --> 19:32.440
You went to such great lengths

19:33.120 --> 19:34.320
for the sake of the struggle
for succession?

19:35.640 --> 19:38.520
The struggle for succession
began ten years ago.

19:39.280 --> 19:41.040
The Qingzhou matter was settled long ago.

19:41.120 --> 19:44.920
Even now, do you still want
to blame the Crown Prince?

19:45.760 --> 19:46.960
Do you remember

19:47.040 --> 19:49.440
the strategist Li Qing
in the eldest prince's mansion?

19:50.480 --> 19:52.240
I heard he was a spy from Xiyan.

19:52.320 --> 19:53.400
Wasn't he executed?

19:55.040 --> 19:57.080
That was merely Xuanlie's own explanation.

19:57.800 --> 19:59.600
Li Qing was planted
in the Ministry of Defense.

19:59.680 --> 20:02.880
The Qingzhou massacre
was orchestrated by him and Zhang Yin.

20:03.760 --> 20:06.640
Anticipating that
Xuanlie would eliminate witnesses,

20:06.720 --> 20:08.960
he devised a plan
to hide in the West Mountain Mine.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.800
So, during the Lushan Hunt,

20:11.880 --> 20:13.840
you deliberately disappeared to find him?

20:13.920 --> 20:15.000
That's right.

20:15.840 --> 20:17.360
Now, Li Qing is in my mansion.

20:18.160 --> 20:19.560
This is his confession.

20:19.640 --> 20:20.920
The evidence and witnesses are all here.

20:21.000 --> 20:24.160
If you still have doubts,
you are welcome to verify them.

20:38.080 --> 20:40.080
The Crown Prince feared I would
return and overturn the case,

20:40.160 --> 20:42.400
so he administered
a slow-acting poison to our father.

20:42.480 --> 20:44.240
Eunuch Liu has been imprisoned
by the Crown Prince

20:44.320 --> 20:45.800
for secretly giving our father
an antidote.

20:46.440 --> 20:48.520
Now, the only one who can save Eunuch Liu

20:49.120 --> 20:50.360
is you.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.720
The Yin family has always been loyal.

20:56.800 --> 20:58.520
At this critical moment for Great Yan,

20:58.600 --> 21:01.600
I hope you can act decisively

21:01.680 --> 21:03.240
and turn the situation around.

21:09.560 --> 21:13.560
I failed to prevent Prince Jing's
people from acting.

21:14.320 --> 21:16.800
But the Crown Princess burnt the letter

21:16.880 --> 21:17.880
and said

21:18.720 --> 21:21.760
in any situation,
she would stand by Your Highness.

21:24.360 --> 21:25.440
Got it.

21:27.400 --> 21:28.920
How is the interrogation
of Liu Zhong going?

21:29.760 --> 21:30.840
Don't worry, Your Highness.

21:31.600 --> 21:33.080
An expert executioner

21:33.160 --> 21:35.200
can break even the strongest will
within two days.

21:36.200 --> 21:38.040
Liu Zhong has always favored Prince Jing.

21:38.800 --> 21:41.280
Planning to assassinate the Crown Prince
while exploiting the Emperor's illness

21:41.360 --> 21:43.840
to secure the throne for Prince Jing.

21:49.320 --> 21:51.280
If he signs this confession,

21:51.360 --> 21:54.120
Prince Jing will surely face death.

22:42.600 --> 22:43.680
Eunuch Liu,

22:44.680 --> 22:48.680
for my third brother,
you are so cruel to yourself.

22:49.640 --> 22:54.360
I would rather die than let you prevail.

22:58.640 --> 23:00.040
When you will die

23:01.320 --> 23:02.960
is up to me.

23:04.080 --> 23:05.400
General Yin. Please stop, General Yin.

23:21.440 --> 23:23.080
General Yin,

23:23.680 --> 23:26.600
the Crown Prince committed regicide
and treason by poisoning the Emperor.

23:26.680 --> 23:28.800
He killed 100,000 Qingzhou…

23:31.520 --> 23:34.400
General Yin, you've misjudged him.

23:36.480 --> 23:39.360
Kill me and save His Majesty.

23:41.200 --> 23:44.160
Scoundrel, how dare you slander me!

23:47.080 --> 23:49.760
Kill me and save His Majesty.

23:58.280 --> 24:00.040
When Luomei dons her armor,

24:00.120 --> 24:02.040
she leads the Pingnan Army
of 30,000 as a general.

24:02.120 --> 24:03.560
When she removes her armor,

24:04.160 --> 24:05.120
she leads me alone as the Crown Princess.

24:07.960 --> 24:09.600
Your Highness,
as the heir apparent of Great Yan,

24:10.200 --> 24:11.560
you are known
for your benevolence and kindness,

24:11.640 --> 24:13.720
loving your people
as a father loves his children.

24:14.680 --> 24:18.400
No matter what happens,
I will stand by you.

24:19.720 --> 24:23.640
Didn't you promise to stand with me
in defending Great Yan?

24:24.400 --> 24:26.120
The Yin family has always been loyal.

24:26.200 --> 24:28.320
At this critical moment for Great Yan,

24:28.400 --> 24:31.200
I hope you can act decisively

24:31.280 --> 24:32.720
and turn the situation around.

26:03.800 --> 26:04.680
Luomei.

26:04.760 --> 26:05.680
Luomei.

26:07.200 --> 26:10.200
You schemed against my aunt
and the entire Yin family.

26:10.280 --> 26:12.000
As a daughter of the Yin family,

26:13.320 --> 26:14.320
do I have a choice?

26:18.720 --> 26:19.560
Yes.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.520
It was me.

26:22.560 --> 26:25.120
I schemed against Jinghe,
and I schemed for the throne.

26:25.840 --> 26:27.760
I plotted against everything
within my sight.

26:28.640 --> 26:29.960
But I never schemed against you.

26:30.960 --> 26:32.880
So, what they said is all true.

26:34.600 --> 26:35.440
Why?

26:40.240 --> 26:41.600
Because in your eyes,

26:41.680 --> 26:43.520
there is forever only Murong Jinghe.

26:44.960 --> 26:47.040
If it weren't for my decisive actions
in Qingzhou

26:47.120 --> 26:48.520
that caused Jinghe to lose
the people's support,

26:48.600 --> 26:50.400
how could my father make me
the Crown Prince?

26:51.520 --> 26:53.480
And how could I stand
before you like this,

26:54.080 --> 26:55.240
so that you could see me?

26:57.400 --> 27:00.440
Luomei, you have promised me a lifetime.

27:00.520 --> 27:01.680
I won't allow you to take it back.

27:04.360 --> 27:06.920
I spared his life
regarding the Qingzhou incident,

27:07.720 --> 27:09.160
but he refuses to let it go,

27:09.240 --> 27:10.880
insisting on overturning the verdict,

27:10.960 --> 27:12.800
disrupting you and me,
and ruining everything.

27:12.880 --> 27:15.840
As long as he is around,
I will always be the loser.

27:24.560 --> 27:25.480
Slap me again.

27:26.520 --> 27:28.040
Even to this day,

27:29.040 --> 27:31.200
you show no remorse whatsoever.

27:37.640 --> 27:40.760
Slap me until you are no longer angry.

27:44.160 --> 27:45.440
This slap

27:46.040 --> 27:48.960
is for all the wronged souls in Qingzhou.

27:53.760 --> 27:54.640
This slap

27:55.320 --> 27:58.280
is for His Majesty who placed
high hopes in you.

28:03.040 --> 28:03.960
This slap

28:04.640 --> 28:06.640
is for myself.

28:10.360 --> 28:12.640
I falsely claim to be loyal
to the Emperor and the country.

28:18.360 --> 28:20.640
I actually fell in love with you.

28:37.920 --> 28:39.920
Just pretend that nothing happened.

28:40.520 --> 28:41.720
It was me who plotted treason.

28:41.800 --> 28:43.480
Everything is unrelated to you.

28:48.000 --> 28:50.600
Luomei, trust me.

28:51.360 --> 28:54.360
I will fulfill what I promised you.

28:59.800 --> 29:03.160
XIEYING PAVILION

29:07.080 --> 29:08.760
The Red Fruit has sprouted.

29:10.040 --> 29:11.280
It's a good sign.

29:11.920 --> 29:14.640
I wish General Yin can bring us good news.

29:36.800 --> 29:37.680
How could it be so hot?

29:39.480 --> 29:40.800
I just caught a cold.

29:48.240 --> 29:49.080
It's nothing.

29:56.640 --> 29:58.080
The leeches are alive.

29:58.160 --> 30:01.640
But if you want to persist on,
it will harm your health.

30:03.520 --> 30:04.880
I can endure it.

30:07.600 --> 30:08.640
The medicine is ready.

30:17.880 --> 30:21.480
My lord, after taking the medicine,
you will feel better.

30:23.400 --> 30:24.440
Physician,

30:24.960 --> 30:27.000
he doesn't seem to have caught a cold.

30:27.080 --> 30:27.920
What's the matter with him?

30:28.840 --> 30:29.880
- He…
- You may leave now.

30:31.360 --> 30:32.520
I'll take my leave.

30:43.040 --> 30:44.320
You are hiding something from me.

30:45.320 --> 30:47.640
- Nothing.
- You still say there is nothing.

30:48.360 --> 30:49.960
I smelled your medicine just now.

30:50.680 --> 30:51.960
There is Xuanhu in it.

30:52.560 --> 30:54.000
It's for killing pain.

30:54.920 --> 30:56.160
Are you wounded?

31:01.640 --> 31:02.800
I really can't hide anything from you.

31:04.280 --> 31:06.000
This is an old ailment from Qingzhou.

31:06.680 --> 31:09.320
Damp weather makes the pain unbearable.

31:10.360 --> 31:12.560
After taking the medicine,
I will recover very soon.

31:12.640 --> 31:13.760
You hid it from me again.

31:16.320 --> 31:17.720
Why are you always like this?

31:21.520 --> 31:23.760
- I'm just afraid…
- Afraid I would worry?

31:27.640 --> 31:28.480
Jinghe,

31:31.000 --> 31:32.120
you have to promise me.

31:33.200 --> 31:35.280
No matter what happens in the future,

31:37.440 --> 31:38.640
don't hide anything from me.

31:43.040 --> 31:46.120
Assassinate Murong Jinghe.

31:46.200 --> 31:49.520
You acted on your own

31:49.600 --> 31:51.040
and betrayed the Shadow Works.

31:51.840 --> 31:54.160
You should meet your end.

31:56.040 --> 31:58.840
- Mei Lin, actually, I…
- My lord.

32:01.760 --> 32:03.600
My lord, something happened.

32:03.680 --> 32:05.120
The Eastern Palace sent this to us.

32:05.200 --> 32:07.680
Eunuch Liu died. General Yin killed him.

32:09.480 --> 32:10.520
What should we do now?

32:10.600 --> 32:11.840
The Emperor's antidote
must not be interrupted

32:11.920 --> 32:13.440
or all previous efforts will be in vain.

32:15.160 --> 32:16.480
I can ask Concubine Yan for help.

32:16.560 --> 32:17.680
Right.

32:17.760 --> 32:20.440
Concubine Yan is a consort of Great Yan
and also the princess of Xiyan.

32:20.520 --> 32:22.640
Now, only she can enter
the Yanming Palace.

32:23.640 --> 32:25.400
I only need to sneak
into the Fanghua Palace

32:25.480 --> 32:27.200
and give her the antidote.

32:32.840 --> 32:35.480
Remember, no matter what happens,

32:36.080 --> 32:37.360
don't leave Fanghua Palace.

32:38.000 --> 32:38.840
Okay.

32:53.320 --> 32:58.440
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

33:05.360 --> 33:06.560
Be careful.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.840
Keep my hairpin well.

33:21.960 --> 33:23.280
If it is damaged,

33:24.080 --> 33:25.520
you'll have to spend your life
making it up to me.

33:30.680 --> 33:31.560
Wait for me to come back.

33:59.080 --> 34:00.800
I will protect it well.

34:01.600 --> 34:02.960
When you come back,

34:03.520 --> 34:06.360
I will tell you everything.

34:07.080 --> 34:08.400
I only wish that at that time,

34:08.480 --> 34:12.440
you would still promise me a lifetime.

34:16.159 --> 34:17.000
My lord.

34:22.000 --> 34:22.920
My lord.

34:24.080 --> 34:26.159
My lord. My lord.

35:14.320 --> 35:19.800
FANGHUA PALACE

35:22.920 --> 35:24.000
Chagu.

35:24.720 --> 35:25.760
Chagu.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.560
- Your Highness.
- Chagu,

35:31.560 --> 35:33.320
have you found out where Eunuch Liu is?

35:33.400 --> 35:35.240
Your Highness, rumors are spreading

35:35.320 --> 35:37.440
that Eunuch Liu fell critically ill
and passed away last night.

35:39.600 --> 35:40.640
How could this be?

35:41.880 --> 35:44.760
Your Highness, if His Majesty passes away,

35:44.840 --> 35:46.880
you'll have nobody
to rely on in the palace.

35:47.560 --> 35:49.520
Let's listen to the Prince Heir
and go back to Xiyan.

35:51.280 --> 35:52.920
No, I can't go.

35:53.000 --> 35:54.600
If I leave, what about His Majesty?

35:54.680 --> 35:55.840
The Prince Heir said

35:55.920 --> 35:57.600
His Majesty has arranged
everything for you.

35:57.680 --> 35:58.800
If you don't leave,

35:58.880 --> 36:00.400
you will be betraying
His Majesty's goodwill.

36:04.440 --> 36:07.080
His Majesty has arranged
everything for me.

36:07.160 --> 36:09.520
How could I leave
when he is in such peril?

36:09.600 --> 36:12.720
But if you don't leave, what can you do?

36:13.800 --> 36:14.800
I…

36:14.880 --> 36:15.720
Your Highness.

36:18.840 --> 36:20.360
Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

36:21.200 --> 36:22.040
Mei Lin.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.920
- You are drenched.
- Your Highness.

36:24.000 --> 36:25.280
Chagu, fetch some dry clothes.

36:26.600 --> 36:29.480
Your Highness, we've found a way
to save His Majesty.

36:29.560 --> 36:31.000
Now, only you can save him.

36:31.080 --> 36:32.280
Me?

36:46.040 --> 36:48.240
- How is it?
- The leeches are dead.

36:48.320 --> 36:50.080
Well, what about Prince Jing?

36:51.120 --> 36:54.400
The excruciating pain,
which even Xuanhu cannot suppress,

36:55.160 --> 36:56.800
has caused Prince Jing to pass out.

36:56.880 --> 37:00.400
This detoxification method
may not succeed.

37:00.480 --> 37:04.440
Moreover, such pain is unbearable
for an ordinary person.

37:05.760 --> 37:07.760
It was me who caused her
to be poisoned with Momai.

37:08.760 --> 37:12.320
No matter how painful, I should endure it.

37:15.360 --> 37:17.400
When the Emperor wakes,
we can bring down the Crown Prince.

37:17.480 --> 37:19.520
Then we can get the Snow Dragon Whisker.

37:19.600 --> 37:22.120
Why must you put yourself in danger?

37:23.440 --> 37:24.960
I dare not bet on the only choice.

37:26.040 --> 37:27.360
One more method of detoxification,

37:28.040 --> 37:31.120
for her, is one more chance to survive.

37:33.600 --> 37:35.320
You must first ingest the poison.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.880
Then I can use your body

37:37.960 --> 37:40.320
to test the leech detoxification method.

37:41.320 --> 37:44.520
You will have to endure the pain
of the leeches' bites.

37:44.600 --> 37:46.520
If you can't hold on,

37:46.600 --> 37:48.560
you must take the antidote promptly,

37:48.640 --> 37:51.440
or it will endanger your own life.

37:52.320 --> 37:55.040
But Prince Jing has taken the antidote.

37:55.120 --> 37:57.120
He should wake up very soon.

38:04.040 --> 38:05.120
Your Highness.

38:05.200 --> 38:06.280
Your Highness.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.520
Your Highness,

38:08.120 --> 38:09.720
how is His Majesty?

38:10.320 --> 38:13.400
Concubine Yan, you don't understand
the rules of attending to the sick.

38:13.480 --> 38:15.800
I will oversee things here
at the Yanming Palace.

38:15.880 --> 38:16.800
You may go back.

38:17.680 --> 38:20.320
Your Highness,
His Majesty can't wake up, can he?

38:21.880 --> 38:23.160
Don't talk nonsense.

38:24.680 --> 38:26.320
But everyone in the palace said so.

38:27.000 --> 38:28.240
I beg you, Your Highness.

38:28.320 --> 38:30.320
Please let me in to see His Majesty.

38:30.400 --> 38:31.320
I know I'm useless.

38:31.400 --> 38:33.640
I can't cure His Majesty,
but I just want to stay with him.

38:33.720 --> 38:35.080
Let me go in. I beg you.

38:36.880 --> 38:39.080
Your Highness. Your Highness.

38:39.160 --> 38:40.440
I beg you, Your Highness.

38:40.520 --> 38:42.120
Please let me in to see His Majesty.
Your Highness.

38:42.840 --> 38:44.800
I beg you, Your Highness.

38:46.000 --> 38:46.880
Your Highness,

38:46.960 --> 38:48.920
His Majesty treated me so well.
I just want to stay with him.

38:49.000 --> 38:50.240
Let me go in, okay?

38:50.960 --> 38:52.200
I beg you, Your Highness.

38:52.280 --> 38:54.160
I beg you, Your Highness.

38:54.240 --> 38:55.400
Get up.

39:00.160 --> 39:01.480
You agreed, right?

39:06.920 --> 39:08.400
Your Highness, you…

39:10.000 --> 39:12.680
Anyone wishing to enter
must be searched first.

39:26.240 --> 39:27.840
Yanming Palace is heavily guarded.

39:29.040 --> 39:31.320
Only by becoming the antidote myself

39:31.920 --> 39:33.680
can I avoid detection during a search.

39:47.560 --> 39:48.840
Go in now.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.400
Thank you, Your Highness.

40:42.120 --> 40:43.440
- Catch her.
- Yes.

40:43.520 --> 40:44.360
Follow me.
